request.description:
Registers a new Firebase user and returns an idToken.
Body: { email, password, displayName? }
The test script automatically stores idToken as {{firebaseToken}}.

Signs in an existing Firebase user and returns a fresh idToken.
Body: { email, password }
The test script automatically stores idToken as {{firebaseToken}}.

Creates or updates the user document in MongoDB from the Firebase token claims.
Call this once after sign-up before using any other protected endpoint.
Body: { displayName? }

Fetches the current status of an on-ramp transaction.
Path param: transactionId -- auto-saved as {{onrampTransactionId}} by the Create Widget URL request.

Response: { transaction: { status, amount, sourceAmount, sourceCurrency, transakStatus, ... } }
